{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aed7fc6e24cd4b6919951e0203e99fd1b1b1469f46d326f697ca8a3a721d8b8c", "ja": "初センターに選ばれた未来。ウキウキ気分も\nつかの間、センターとして何をすればいいの\nかわからず戸惑ってしまう。だが春香やプロ\nデューサーの言葉をヒントに迷いを振り切り\nいざステージへ……！", "zh": "未来第一次被选为Center，然而兴奋期待\n只持续了片刻，她不知道Center该做什么，\n为此感到十分困惑。但春香和制作人的话点醒\n了她，让她挥别烦恼，顺利登上舞台……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "4627dbabc6ab9787449a79e8ca63edfa34ffdefc6671c1a79f93e8c1189d73d7", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cf6f23fcaa89a7d30ce7cbe4eb7a4eb64a7dd614d174e93d5964f13f18f338aa", "ja": "未来、お疲れさま！", "zh": "未来，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "844d8e80c73db7ec7fe81a37f58b0795673021062dae86e74f049ef0c2694428", "ja": "あの、あの！\n私のセンター、どうでしたか！？", "zh": "请、请问！\n我当Center的表现怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0c32130ed0ca3cbe87296a7702af1078f6cf03a5fb11fbf0c0bfab98e4579d6d", "ja": "ああ、頑張ったな。すごく良かったぞ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，你很努力喔，表现得非常好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "f4cc21ba61e4daa998382052ddaa2d3c0fd9f96be4a31915f7020aad29746fc9", "ja": "でへへ～♪\nそんな、すごくないですよ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪\n也没有那么好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "cf6f23fcaa89a7d30ce7cbe4eb7a4eb64a7dd614d174e93d5964f13f18f338aa", "ja": "未来、お疲れさま！", "zh": "未来，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ef694612e798723c60a113a5a593e3e147679306654a461e3b90f294650382f2", "ja": "も～。未来ってば、さっきから呼んでるのに～。\nひとりで走ってっちゃうんだも～ん。", "zh": "未来真是的～我从刚刚就一直叫你，\n你却一个人跑走了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b0c94d45bdf896b73c5922d9c5cb7e41b454ba81d67a64c78a35a9d0fb4945d", "ja": "ごめんね、翼！　{$P$}さんに、\nはやく感想聞きたくって……。", "zh": "对不起，翼！我想赶快听\n{$P$}先生的感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "79358edd74f4884f24e6add8a13c7d1864599c3e28fca17eb6a23e67762a58cc", "ja": "初センター、先を越されたのはちょっと悔しいけど\n……でも、すごくよかったわ。", "zh": "虽然被你抢先有了第一次当Center的经验\n有点不甘心……但你做得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6949a2415aa5c98e8bff57d566cd63d82edb5358e4627e738b615423078aefac", "ja": "いいな～、センター。わたしもやりたいかも～。", "zh": "真好～可以当Center。我也想要当当看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "057e2ff5a6e7ce17efea5373aef675b00fe3ebf7aaa4b85c94ba7ff44a8d5abf", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nセンターって、すっ……ごく楽しいんですね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n当Center真的……好开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "82348b86e0efa998ba2e176768047b271d137a2e4155aa7fa70a532b77bfe889", "ja": "ステージがとっても広くて、キラキラしてて……\nなんか、すごーい！って感じでした！", "zh": "舞台好大，而且闪闪发亮……\n怎么说呢，就是觉得好～厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ec13bfd330a25749462521de83a54c7f4e8442447a4623091282dd5cd8e6d654", "ja": "そうか。\nセンター、楽しかっただろ？", "zh": "这样啊。\n当Center很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "141d730b4071ae44e5ca6f15c765f894b0c24db6404a4e88a00d3e0763040d9e", "ja": "はいっ♪　私、とっても、\nとーっても、楽しかったです♪", "zh": "是的♪\n我表演得非常非～常开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f3b3b99a7f7eb947ee43ec0048b62173da369fd7b87421a23c1dfd80ce599379", "ja": "って、ああ～っ！？", "zh": "对了，啊啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "497c98483a10c29b9741f771117be01cb61ea80306652e9785703212b202dd3d", "ja": "ど、どうした、未来？", "zh": "怎、怎么了，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "daa2700e136576e1c09b9d1d8ddf24e4b5ade19a85b41fd2b17f7a7ea9d0bf39", "ja": "あの、私はすっごく楽しかったですけど、\nお客さんは……楽しかったのかな？", "zh": "那个，我是很开心没错，\n但观众们……开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "72e865609218f952b799f7925565bff2af98fb48c10fac354ab9774dd5a40a2d", "ja": "それは……。\n静香と翼が、よく知ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "这个嘛……\n静香和翼应该很清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "9042219ac76190256c3ef59c496c1a15f872f99754bdafdfe58239ce82e8c641", "ja": "静香ちゃんと翼……？", "zh": "小静和翼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "92bca664eb4a83c92509cdf93a79496aea0ed4adc265aa268bcd68285af07dbe", "ja": "もう、未来ったら……\nお客さんの顔、ちゃんと見てなかったの？", "zh": "未来也真是的……\n你都没有好好观察观众的表情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0aec5479901cbe8adf83ea90f9f529c28ee99dac254d0e193ef02225e1012b24", "ja": "わたしは、すっごく楽しかったよ！\nお客さんも、ニコニコしてたと思うな～。", "zh": "我很享受这场表演喔！\n观众们应该也都笑咪咪的吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc644c978149891e445aabe345249f3b5e83b4fac1c5d474afebf891ae3a327c", "ja": "未来につられるみたいに、私達も……。\nお客さんも、ね？", "zh": "就像被未来影响，我们都很沉浸在其中……\n观众也是，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "4e3aa8b8abcb4c669e34687811f829e91e6b82b480a9289810fd1dd7106ce607", "ja": "お客さんも？　ホント！？", "zh": "观众也是吗？真的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a52d3297dc159e48615dd3a177b255cb48c1d819be48f667ea8b2327596d755d", "ja": "未来の楽しい気持ちで、みんなをどんどん巻き込んで\nいった。……そんなステージだったよ。", "zh": "未来快乐的心情渐渐地感染了大家……\n这就是未来呈现出来的表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "718d0a68e488644a34e704caa63f0ad4d296671318cfd5b28e4b694e1103db74", "ja": "みんなに楽しんでもらえたから、\n未来も楽しめたんだと思う。よくやった、未来！", "zh": "大家都乐在其中，所以未来也才会这么开心。\n很棒喔，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "80c43b994be2bb11283f15a6903013172a934381757315084bab5b10d47dc4e4", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1026_p", "source_sha256": "88b08f9301b703dd545749a410e4d445dbbc71ac3c701f0452b235916b51b73b", "ja": "でもMCの時に、紹介する順番を間違えただろ？\n反省点も忘れないようにな。", "zh": "不过主持时，介绍顺序搞错了吧？\n该反省的部分，也不要忘记喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c28e7b119733536233ba3ed7a30c5d10bf3516b5a6e80a7359155fe1732ece7", "ja": "あ。は、はいっ、気をつけます！\n私……次も、頑張りますね！", "zh": "啊，好、好的，我会多加注意！\n我……下次也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "a249386375a64f66919eabe3c2306a1fc4fbf02a71ffc0123186aa73abd9b1b0", "ja": "そうだ！\n私、春香さんにも報告しなくちゃ！", "zh": "对了！\n我得和春香报告这件事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "9e4b43fae23d70d397a6dbb320052a34af66998c49f4bfd0d726eb049ff1559e", "ja": "初センター、無事に終わりました～って！\nでへへ～♪", "zh": "告诉她我第一次当Center的表演顺利结束了！\n嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f80417ea92d38bcb95d55560f33550f22cc5840399b87e39e594c8b6f6989c70", "ja": "春香なら、会場で観てたはずだけど……。\nもう外に出たかな？", "zh": "春香的话，她应该有来现场看……\n可能已经出去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "3c492013c18afcc1c36759c2d2933da8a971f6bdb63286cc4aeb42e4a67e53e8", "ja": "ええっ、本当ですか！？\nは、春香さ～ん！！　待って～！！！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？\n春、春香～！！等等我～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "dfa3c95b4c45a2a8931745c9c9d2e3ed12e4a727a73863ee00f6153e8561504b", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと未来、今から追いかける気！？", "zh": "等、等一下，未来，你现在要去追她吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5663de62918d8cab7f9f98ac3b1d6d376ba6b080037b672e4838f61ed013c439", "ja": "もう追いつけないってば～！", "zh": "已经追不上了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1034_p", "source_sha256": "bf35080515b4b25c3c79c47bc12e8a975a310b6c9076a1c19011f5ff3eb306a5", "ja": "（これから未来は、もっともっと成長して、\nさらに大きな夢を掴むだろう）", "zh": "（未来往后还会继续成长，\n实现更远大的梦想吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_001_1035_p", "source_sha256": "510367ad6236a9b163c64f998a21e33714298719154bb77e32195fa84835e786", "ja": "（もっと大きな会場で、もっともっと多くのファンを\n巻き込んで……。みんなで、一緒に！）", "zh": "（在更大的会场中，吸引更多更多的粉丝……\n和大家一起实现这个梦想！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
